{"product_id":"the-teeth-of-the-tiger-inspiration-for-the-thrilling-amazon-prime-series-jack-ryan-jack-ryan-jr","title":"The Teeth of the Tiger: INSPIRATION FOR THE THRILLING AMAZON PRIME SERIES JACK RYAN (Jack Ryan Jr)","description":"\u003cp\u003eINSPIRATION FOR THE THRILLING AMAZON PRIME SERIES JACK RYAN . . .The Teeth of the Tiger is the first Jack Ryan Jr novel by Tom Clancy.Just before Jack Ryan stepped down as US President, he created a secret organisation designed to operate in areas where the CIA and FBI couldn't go - able to use any and all means to neutralise terrorists who threatened America. Now his son, Jack Ryan, Jr, is part of that organisation and he's on the front line when a group of Islamic terrorists backed up by Colombian drug smuggles strike at the heart of American society. With no conventional way to hit back at the shadowy ringleaders, it's left to Jack Ryan Jr to take on the terrorists the only way he knows how . . .Internationally bestselling author Tom Clancy first introduced Jack Ryan Jr in The Teeth of the Tiger, returning to his story in Dead or Alive and Locked On. Threat Vector, the fourth thriller in the gripping series, will be available from Penguin in December 2012.Praise for Tom Clancy:'Incredibly addictive . . . 400 tightly woven, adrenalin-fuelled pages' Daily Mail'Truly riveting, a dazzling read' Sunday Express'Heart-stopping action . . . entertaining and eminently topical' Washington Post'Classic Clancy . . . well-constructed tension and realistic action' Short List\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tom Clancy\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405915496\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 640\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45746387091609,"sku":"16RB-3-9781405915496","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d4c6f1b8a6d_The_Teeth_of_the_Tiger-_INSPIRATION_FOR_THE_THRILLING_AMAZON_PRIME_SERIES_JACK_RYAN__Jack_Ryan_Jr__Tom_Clancy.jpg?v=1758796499","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-teeth-of-the-tiger-inspiration-for-the-thrilling-amazon-prime-series-jack-ryan-jack-ryan-jr","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}